Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.95,Hook,,0,0,0,,$224 invoice\N{\c&H0069D2EB&}no account
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two hundred twenty four dollars, invoiced in under a minute, and nobody made an account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:08.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is invoice-generator.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Type your bakery's name, then the café you're billing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:14.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six dozen croissants at $24.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Add a line: ten sourdough loaves at $8.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:20.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Put your payment terms in the notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:23.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Open Invoice Settings and switch the currency to Canadian dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:27.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,The total updates by itself: $224.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hit Download and you've got a PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:32.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,The site says it's free, with no limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:36.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,The catch: it keeps your invoices only in this browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:41.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clear your history and they're gone for good, so save every PDF to a folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:44.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sending invoices from the site needs an account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:48.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send this to the baker who still builds invoices in Word.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.89,0:00:41.69,Lab,,0,0,0,,Saved only in this browser
